  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyamurinda Coffee Growers: Increasing Coffee Quality and Productivity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyamurinda Coffee Growers Ltd is a women founded, owned and led company that grows and processes coffee in Nyamagabe and Karongi Districts of Rwanda. They work directly with coffee farmers, most of whom are grouped into a cooperative: Karora cooperative with 546 members including 228 female members. They wish to increase quantities and improve the quality of processing at the WS including a well equipped coffee cupping lab. They also wish to expand the cherries reception capacity at the WS with additional drying beds.</narrative>
  </description>
